{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2021-08-27 14:00:00', 'title': 'RICHMOND/HAMPTON ROADS ASSOCIATES RATIFY NEW AGREEMENT WITH THE KROGER MID-ATLANTIC DIVISION', 'text': 'RICHMOND, VA., AUG. 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0KROGER (NYSE: KR) MID-ATLANTIC DIVISION\xa0ASSOCIATES IN THE RICHMOND/HAMPTON ROADS BARGAINING UNIT HAVE RATIFIED A NEW COLLECTIVE BARGAINING AGREEMENT BETWEEN THE COMPANY AND THE UNITED FOOD AND COMMERCIAL WORKERS UNION, LOCAL 400.'}